{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <i>Meina</i> returns from a walk,<br>she finds the <strong>Slug Snail Village</strong> overrun by <strong>parasitic slimes</strong>!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village elder\u2014<strong>the only one who wasn\u2019t infected</strong>\u2014tells her:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To bring everyone back to normal, you\u2019ll need two things...<br>Fresh slimes and hydrangeas.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To gather the ingredients, Meina heads into the mysterious garden...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch those corners...</strong><br>Dash through a maze-like garden as a slug snail,<br>evading enemies while collecting slimes in this gooey, dot-eating tag game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The keys to victory are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Slime Dash</strong>, a high-speed move to zip around the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Slime Trail</strong>, which restores the moisture needed for dashing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the slime trails left behind by enemies and other slimes to move more efficiently\u2014but be warned, doing so puts you at greater risk of an encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the <strong>blue fresh slimes</strong> before time runs out to clear the stage.<br>Will you dash to attack or escape?<br>Master the timing and routes to aim for a high score!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820430?t=1751364259","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820430?t=1751364259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820430/6aaadd240f84a7a2b2bff2eb76475fda63c4cc9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751364259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820430/6aaadd240f84a7a2b2bff2eb76475fda63c4cc9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751364259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <i>Meina</i> returns from a walk,<br>she finds the <strong>Slug Snail Village</strong> overrun by <strong>parasitic slimes</strong>!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village elder\u2014<strong>the only one who wasn\u2019t infected</strong>\u2014tells her:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To bring everyone back to normal, you\u2019ll need two things...<br>Fresh slimes and hydrangeas.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To gather the ingredients, Meina heads into the mysterious garden...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch those corners...</strong><br>Dash through a maze-like garden as a slug snail,<br>evading enemies while collecting slimes in this gooey, dot-eating tag game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The keys to victory are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Slime Dash</strong>, a high-speed move to zip around the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Slime Trail</strong>, which restores the moisture needed for dashing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the slime trails left behind by enemies and other slimes to move more efficiently\u2014but be warned, doing so puts you at greater risk of an encounter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the <strong>blue fresh slimes</strong> before time runs out to clear the stage.<br>Will you dash to attack or escape?<br>Master the timing and routes to aim for a high score!</p>","developers":["CREA CLAN","KamiEna"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":